{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"cinderling","model_identifier":"cinderling","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# cinderling\n\nCinderling (C2), climber, 0.9 m = 33 u nose to rump (15 u at the shoulder), plus a 1.1 m whip tail.\n\nA small skinny red demon that scampers on all fours: brick-red cracked skin with glowing orange cracks (glow_crack cubes and painted cracks), little swept-back black horns, black claws, burning orange-yellow eyes and a long whip tail with a black spade tip. Quadruped rig: root > body > rear, neck > head > jaw, tail_1 > tail_2 > tail_3, legs leg_upper/leg_lower/paw.\n\n- Cubes: 32 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -4.0..4.0, y 0.0..19.9, z -23.4..46.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 9 x 17 x 32 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = -2, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 2.4 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 0.45 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.3 | loop |  |\n| `attack_claw` | 0.95 | once | key 0.45 s: right-claw rake after rearing up (second rake 0.6) |\n| `climb` | 0.7 | loop | in place on a wall at -Z, about 1 u in front of the paws (wall face z ~ -14); loop |\n| `ignite` | 1.7 | once | rears against a wooden wall in front, rakes it four times; key 1.05 s: the wall catches fire |\n| `aggro` | 1.2 | once | arched back, lashing tail, hiss |\n| `injured` | 0.45 | once | yelping flinch |\n| `death` | 1.1 | hold | legs give, rolls onto its side, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 56.9 u/s (1.60 m/s), cycle 0.45 s, 25.6 u per cycle (scuttling trot)\n- `run`: 177.8 u/s (5.00 m/s), cycle 0.3 s, 53.3 u per cycle (scampering gallop)\n- `climb`: 1.2 m/s = 43 u/s straight up (loop is in place)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_claw`: key 0.45 s: right-claw rake after rearing up (second rake 0.6)\n- `ignite`: rears against a wooden wall in front, rakes it four times; key 1.05 s: the wall catches fire\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l and glow_crack_* are the lit cubes.\n"},"description":"# cinderling\n\nCinderling (C2), climber, 0.9 m = 33 u nose to rump (15 u at the shoulder), plus a 1.1 m whip tail.\n\nA small skinny red demon that scampers on all fours: brick-red cracked skin with glowing orange cracks (glow_crack cubes and painted cracks), little swept-back black horns, black claws, burning orange-yellow eyes and a long whip tail with a black spade tip. Quadruped rig: root > body > rear, neck > head > jaw, tail_1 > tail_2 > tail_3, legs leg_upper/leg_lower/paw.\n\n- Cubes: 32 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -4.0..4.0, y 0.0..19.9, z -23.4..46.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 9 x 17 x 32 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = -2, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 2.4 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 0.45 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.3 | loop |  |\n| `attack_claw` | 0.95 | once | key 0.45 s: right-claw rake after rearing up (second rake 0.6) |\n| `climb` | 0.7 | loop | in place on a wall at -Z, about 1 u in front of the paws (wall face z ~ -14); loop |\n| `ignite` | 1.7 | once | rears against a wooden wall in front, rakes it four times; key 1.05 s: the wall catches fire |\n| `aggro` | 1.2 | once | arched back, lashing tail, hiss |\n| `injured` | 0.45 | once | yelping flinch |\n| `death` | 1.1 | hold | legs give, rolls onto its side, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 56.9 u/s (1.60 m/s), cycle 0.45 s, 25.6 u per cycle (scuttling trot)\n- `run`: 177.8 u/s (5.00 m/s), cycle 0.3 s, 53.3 u per cycle (scampering gallop)\n- `climb`: 1.2 m/s = 43 u/s straight up (loop is in place)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_claw`: key 0.45 s: right-claw rake after rearing up (second rake 0.6)\n- `ignite`: rears against a wooden wall in front, rakes it four times; key 1.05 s: the wall catches fire\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l and glow_crack_* are the lit cubes.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-3.5,8.0,-12.5],"to":[3.5,15.0,1.25],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,11.5,-2.5],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[32,14,39.0,21.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[4,14,17.75,21.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[39,14,46.0,21.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[18,14,31.75,21.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,7.0,13.75],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[7,0,14.0,13.75],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"f7fdbfcc-22a7-5283-b750-122c81f8c0ef"},{"name":"waist","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-2.5,10.0,1.25],"to":[2.5,14.5,12.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,11.5,1.25],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[12,22,17.0,26.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[114,14,125.25,18.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[17,22,22.0,26.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,22,11.25,26.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[18,0,23.0,11.25],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[23,0,28.0,11.25],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"96750d3c-037e-52a1-bf75-b316037d731b"},{"name":"neck","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-2.0,8.0,-15.5],"to":[2.0,15.5,-9.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,12.0,-10.5],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[90,0,94.0,7.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[78,0,84.0,7.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[94,0,98.0,7.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[84,0,9